"""Frozen BASE18/CATEGORY30/CONTEXT182 comparison for weekly H2.

The CLI is deliberately fail closed.  It consumes only sealed compact artifacts,
fits exactly the two predeclared models, and reuses pinned pure evaluator/replay
functions.  Importing this module never reads data or fits a model.
"""

